From a3f057c74d72300aaf83cc3b6aca3842b2a11cf6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kara Kutu <kk@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 22:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] power: hisi: coul: match the EMUI 9 hi6555v200 coul
 compatible

P30 lite (MAR) EMUI 9 device trees describe the HI6555V200 coulometer as
"hisilicon_hi6555v200_coul" (the stock 4.9.111 driver name), while this
tree's generalized hi6xxx driver only matched "hisilicon_hi6xxx_coul".
The coul never probed, so coul_core failed (-1, no ops), charging_core
failed to get battery params (-EINVAL) and huawei_charger failed (-EINVAL):
no battery data and no charger control.

Add the EMUI 9 compatible to the OF match table; the driver already uses
the HI6555V200 register map (CONFIG_HISI_COUL_HI6555V200) and reads only
"coulirq" and coul_core/r_coul_mohm, both present in these DTs.

---
 drivers/power/hisi/coul/hi6xxx/hisi_hi6xxx_coul.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/power/hisi/coul/hi6xxx/hisi_hi6xxx_coul.c b/drivers/power/hisi/coul/hi6xxx/hisi_hi6xxx_coul.c
index 3bc64c5da..34224e698 100755
--- a/drivers/power/hisi/coul/hi6xxx/hisi_hi6xxx_coul.c
+++ b/drivers/power/hisi/coul/hi6xxx/hisi_hi6xxx_coul.c
@@ -2108,6 +2108,15 @@ static struct of_device_id hi6xxx_coul_match_table[] =
     {
           .compatible = "hisilicon_hi6xxx_coul",
     },
+    /*
+     * kk (Kara Kutu): EMUI 9 kirin710 DTs (P30 lite / MAR) name the same
+     * HI6555V200 coulometer "hisilicon_hi6555v200_coul" (stock 4.9.111 driver
+     * name). Without this the coul never probes, coul_core fails (-1) and
+     * charging_core / huawei_charger fail with -EINVAL.
+     */
+    {
+          .compatible = "hisilicon_hi6555v200_coul",
+    },
     {},
 };
 
